flowchart TD
  A[You have the expense code<br/>for example PAY-2026-0004]:::people --> B[Open app.truway.xyz/proof<br/>and press Verify]:::truway
  B --> C{Do you have<br/>the invoice file?}
  C -- Yes --> D[Drop it on<br/>Check the invoice]:::truway
  D --> E{Does it match?}
  E -- Yes --> F[The invoice matches:<br/>it is the approved one]:::truway
  E -- No --> G[Not the approved file]:::ext
  C -- No --> H[Check line, account,<br/>who filed and who approved]:::truway
  B --> I[View on Stellar]:::chain
  I --> J[The same record,<br/>outside Truway]:::chain

classDef chain fill:#1E42D8,stroke:#0B1F77,color:#FFFFFF
classDef ext fill:#F2F2F0,stroke:#8F9298,color:#272A30
classDef people fill:#FAF5E8,stroke:#C7A667,color:#332602
classDef soon fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#8F9298,stroke-dasharray:5 4,color:#585B62
classDef truway fill:#F0F4FF,stroke:#243CA6,color:#111318
